# 📖 Pāli & Sanskrit to English Doctrinal Dictionary
### *Grounded in the Discourses of the Buddha and the Living Thai Forest Tradition*

> [!NOTE] Orientation
> This dictionary compiles core Pāli and Sanskrit terms, monastic vocabulary, doctrinal formulations, and psychological concepts used throughout the teachings of **Ajahn Chah, Ajahn Sumedho, Ajahn Amaro, Bhikkhu Bodhi, Ven. Anālayo, Ajahn Sucitto, Ajahn Pasanno, Ajahn Brahm**, and the classical Pāli Canon.

